# WS5-02/04 (resource lifecycle), A1200/KS3.1 under FS-UAE (54x-fs-uae.sh case 540).
# Sources: exec.library autodocs (OpenResource returns a resource pointer; resources
# have no open count and no close call; RemResource removes a resource from the system
# list and is for the resource's owner); spec/appendix-stdlib.md (cardPresent: "True
# when card.resource can be opened"). The A1200 ROM provides card.resource.
# Expected: "card true true", and the walker reports the same state before and after
# (card 1 both times; N = N).
# Contrast 540c (no cardPresent call): the same walker lines.
# Detector: the walker reports card 0 after 54x-seeded.c removes the resource.
expect: script
--- output
before vertb N port 0 card 1
card true true
rc 0
after vertb N port 0 card 1
END
